    "commit": "16fb6291d",
    "summary": "A fourth review round against 5243a4aea found one more P2: the wrapper computed canonicalRepo for the lock key but still passed the original (possibly relative) repoPath to persistVerificationReceiptUnlocked, so a relative repoPath wrote the json/change-log successfully via the lifecycle service's own path resolution but then failed refreshing RECEIPTS.md (\"writeAtomic: path must be absolute\"), leaving the document behind the json. Fixed by passing canonicalRepo through to the unlocked function instead of repoPath. Added a relative-repoPath test asserting json, history and the rendered RECEIPTS.md all reflect the write; confirmed it fails without the fix before restoring it."
  },
